---
description: Vitest unit tests and coverage requirements
globs: **/*.test.ts, **/*.test.tsx, vitest.config.ts, src/test/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Runner: Vitest; config @vitest.config.ts; setup @src/test/setup.ts.
- Coverage threshold: **80%** lines/branches/functions/statements (enforced in `bun run test:coverage`).
- Server DO tests must mock `partyserver` before importing @src/server/index.ts.
- React tests: mock `partysocket/react`; use `cleanup()` between tests; mock `scrollIntoView` in setup.
- Test files are excluded from app tsconfigs (`**/*.test.ts`, `**/*.test.tsx`).
- Add tests when changing pure logic in `validate.ts`, `utils.ts`, `roomId.ts`, `shared.ts`, etc.
- Full gate: `bun run check` (tsc + coverage + wrangler dry-run).
